# synstudio effect
name    glitch
label   Glitch
group   Screen
about   Horizontal slices shoved sideways. Deterministic — the same frame
about   glitches the same way every time, so a scrub and a render agree
param   amount  8   0  60  Shift
param   scale   0.3 0.01 2 Frequency
filter  [$in]format=gbrap,geq=r='r(X+$amount*sin(Y*$scale),Y)':
filter  g='g(X+$amount*sin(Y*$scale),Y)':b='b(X+$amount*sin(Y*$scale),Y)':
filter  a='alpha(X,Y)'[$out]
